                <pb facs="0316" n="970" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg970"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">O.—Ratification by Attorney Lozano.</hi></head>
                <p>On the seventh of the same month, the citizen Toribio Lozano, being present in
                    this court, was informed of the contents of the foregoing, and said that he
                    heard it, requesting that the original statement, when concluded, might be
                    delivered to him with a certified copy; and the foregoing statement having been
                    read to him, he ratified it under oath, saying that all the facts therein
                    contained were true, and that he had not presented this claim previously either
                    to the Mexican or to the American Government, and he signed with the citizen
                    judge before me the secretary. I certify.</p>
                <p>The licentiate,</p>
                <closer><signed>VALDEZ GOMEZ.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>TORIBIO LOZANO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pablo Borrego</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
